            </td>

    <td style="width: 0.97%; vertical-align: bottom;">
              <div style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.25; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;">&#160;</div>
            </td>

    <td style="width: 11.72%; vertical-align: bottom; border-bottom: #000000 2px solid;">
              <div style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.25; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;">Abstentions</div>
            </td>

  </tr>

  <tr>

    <td style="width: 57.76%; vertical-align: top; background-color: #CCEEFF;">
              <div style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.25; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div>
              <div style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.25; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Ilan Hadar</div>
            </td>

    <td style="width: 0.97%; vertical-align: bottom; background-color: #CCEEFF;">
              <div style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.25; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div>
            </td>

    <td style="width: 14.4%; vertical-align: bottom; background-color: #CCEEFF;">
              <div style="text-align: right; line-height: 1.25; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">744,636</div>
              <div style="text-align: right; line-height: 1.25; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"> (96.9%)</div>
            </td>

    <td style="width: 0.97%; vertical-align: bottom; background-color: #CCEEFF;">
              <div style="text-align: right; line-height: 1.25; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div>
            </td>

